{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26162","headline":"鱼上冰 · 王季则","name":"鱼上冰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"北陆收寒尽，东风解冻初。\n冰消通浅溜，气变跃潜鱼。\n应节似知化，扬鬐任所如。\n浮沈非乐藻，沿泝异传书。\n结网时空久，临川意有余。\n爲龙将可望，今日媿才虚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王季则","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26162.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26162","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}